        \item Connect recursively from left to right every pair of neighbouring ${\mkern.5mu\begin{tikzpicture}[x=.27em,y=.45em,decoration={markings,mark=at position 0.99 with {\arrow[black]{Stealth[length=4.8pt]}}}]
