\end{tikzpicture}\mkern.5mu}$ remains, draw a decorated half-line extending downwards starting at it.
        \item Delete the weight $\lambda$.
    \end{enumerate}
    We define the cap diagram $\overline{\lambda}$ to be the mirror image of $\underline{\lambda}$ obtained by reflecting all cups and lines across the fixed horizontal line.

